cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper and this software."
type: software
title: "Replication code: Forecast error prices and equal-cost charging plans for battery-swapping and charging stations"
abstract: >-
  Code that reproduces the tables and figures of the paper "More accurate forecasts, not necessarily
  lower costs: Forecast error prices and equal-cost charging plans for battery-swapping and charging
  stations under time-of-use tariffs" from the public MP-EVData and UrbanEV datasets: data preparation,
  the pre-registered forecasting and decision run, the profit-basis analyses, the battery-level
  simulation, and the figures and tables.
repository-code: "https://github.com/1Jerry0/pact-ev"
version: 1.0.1
date-released: 2026-10-21
license: MIT
authors:
