    given-names: Conglin
    affiliation: "School of Economics and Management, Nanchang Hangkong University"
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Youyuan
    affiliation: "School of Economics and Management, Nanchang Hangkong University"
keywords:
  - battery swapping station
  - electric vehicle charging
  - demand forecasting
  - forecast value
  - time-of-use tariff
